  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till CBD:s fond f&#xf6;r deltagande i FN:s konvention 2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trust fund for participation 2025 to UN Convention on biodiversity (CBD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidrag till resfond f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja utvecklingsl&#xe4;nders och urfolks deltagande i f&#xf6;rhandlingar om FN:s konvention f&#xf6;r biologisk m&#xe5;ngfald, CBD. St&#xf6;d ska bidra till f&#xf6;rhandlingsresultat med fler parters perspektiv, ge b&#xe4;ttre f&#xf6;rankring och legitimitet samt d&#xe4;rmed bidra till att hejda f&#xf6;rlusten av biodiversitet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to trust fund for participation to support participation of developing countries and indigenous people in negotiations on the UN convention on biological diversity, CBD. The support is to contribute to more inclusive, broadly supported and legitimate negotiation outcomes and thus contribute to halting global biodiversity loss.</narrative>
  </description>
